	(text "The AXP192 power-management IC with its inputs, the cell and the backup cell, the SYS I2C pull-ups, the\nBM8563 clock, the power key with the clock's wake path, and the 5 V boost for the Grove port.\n\nMain parts: U2 AXP192, J3 battery, BAT1 backup cell, U4 BM8563, Y1, U8 SGM6603-5.0, S1 power key, R401/C401"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
			)
			(justify left top)
